    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yucatan... doesn't Lateran food bug you at least, like, a little...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tastes here definitely lean on the sugary side, compared to Kjerag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yucatan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you like sweet, though, Rus?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yucatan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That doesn't mean I can take everything sweet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_262_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh* I'm starting to miss Kjerag now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's that bitch Ratatos's fault, all blah blah 'grab every opportunity to reestablish our clan's status'... and she didn\u2019t even come herself, throwing me under the sleigh out here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_262_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a show of the Matriarch's trust in you. After that incident put us on the brink, it was your joint efforts with her that ensured the Browntails held on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yucatan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_262_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And you got tossed off to the side. You just love living behind the scenes, don't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_262_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Personally speaking, getting to see you shine is more than enough satisfaction for me, Rus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yucatan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_262_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ooh, when did you learn to talk so smooth?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_262_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That aside, Madame, this conference may turn out more fruitful than we expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yucatan"
    },
    {
        "text": "We didn't think so many countries would be here. It seems we might've underestimated Laterano's influence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yucatan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_263_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_262_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, that does sound about right... but don't you change the subject!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175"
