        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_175"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Leithanian) Ugh, do you not have eyes?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Leithanian) You bumped into me, I think.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Leithanian is an embarrassment. What corner of the hinterland did you scurry out of?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I come from Kjerag, and it's certainly not the 'hinterland.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Kjerag?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of place is Kjerag?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_175",
        "name2": "avg_npc_360_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lady Sharon, Kjerag is the nation of the Snow Realm in the buffer zone between Victoria, Columbia, and Kazimierz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheery Legatus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_175"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a country in those mountains? Hah, the very definition of hinterland!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think an envoy of a trifling glacial state has the standing to be flippant with me, a duchess?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Madame, first, I have to stress again, Kjerag isn't some 'hinterland' like you keep saying. You can probably thank your own narrow mind that you've never heard of my country.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "Second, you're the one who bumped into me. You owe me an apology.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You dare!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_175",
        "name2": "avg_npc_360_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lady Sharon, we're in the Basilica...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheery Legatus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Lady Sharon, permit I remind you, you currently stand in Laterano, and not your Leithanian domain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And who are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A Lateran Legatus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you trying to tell me, Legatus? This is the Basilica? What, do you intend to declare that as the host, Laterano sides with this provincial creature?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Laterano sides with order. Therefore, Lady Sharon, you should apologize to Madame Sciurus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You know my name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd expect me to know the names of all the diplomatic envoys, wouldn't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? Then you must be well aware of who I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, Duchess Francis of Leithanien.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "But permit I remind you again, this is Laterano, Duchess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "text": "In Laterano, you are asked to honor the Commandments and orderly abide the rule of law. No matter what privileges you enjoy in Leithanien, they do not exist nor apply in Laterano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This is how Laterano treats its guests?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_175",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're willing to be a 'guest of Laterano,' Laterano will wholeheartedly treat you in kind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Oren, when did you start standing for Laterano, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_361_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "As a Lateran Legatus, do I not have the right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not in the Basilica.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lady Sharon, please quell your anger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_175"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. Don't you think it's a little late to be pacifying me, cardinal?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Grace, I beg your understanding. The Legatus who contradicted you will be given an appropriate punishment. And rest assured of the Lateran Curia's goodwill during your stay in the guesthouse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madame Sciurus, I beg your pardon as well. This fault for this minor misunderstanding lies with our shortcomings. If you would be willing to magnanimously accept my apologies, I hope to invite you in a short while to the side rooms for a talk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_263_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "text": "Sciurus looks at Yucatan, and Yucatan gives a subtle nod."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_175"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, Laterans. My, my.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scathing Leithanian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alessoe, Mattina, please look after these three most important guests in my stead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oren, come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Here comes the punishment. Alright, alright...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
