    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, the deceased in Pagus Stevonus did not leave behind a will nor any prior registration of one. I'll return to the Notarial Hall in a bit and submit for double-checking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Currently? I'm at Pagus Stevonus Central Hospital... No, no, I'm alright, I just found a girl injured in a fall, I'm taking her to be examined right now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I wasn't in a traffic accident...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, the parents aren't with her. She's still unconscious, and for the time being we can't confirm her family circumstances. Once she wakes up, I'll bring her back to her guardians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, and if she doesn't wake up soon, I might need to use Notarial Hall privileges to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Pardon? I can consider this one of my practical assignments...? Alright, I'll fill in all the documents after it's over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... sorry for that, I'm finished.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright! The doc's physical checkup is done. No wounds anywhere, nothing on her head, so it probably wasn't a knock on the brain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the girl does have a small fever. Odds are she was ill. She'll still need a few more tests before we're sure what caused her to pass out, but it won't be anything too bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doc's set her up in Ward 2127. You can wait there for the examination results.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is she your sister? Are you on duty? Why are you bringing your little sister on an executor shift? I barely ever see executors here in Stevonus!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She's not my sister.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So why did you bring her here? Is she your target? Oh, Heavens, are executors really that ruthless? You'd execute a little girl like that? What did she do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I only came across her in the street. She's not my target. She just lives in the vicinity, in all likelihood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Really? She must be new around here, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the only hospital in Stevonus, so all the kids come here for checkups when they're sick... you should see the sight of the consulting room at Pediatrics whenever the seasons change. It's exhausting!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucky I'm on shift at Recovery next week. Have you heard of our Recovery department? It's famous!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "text": "The wheelchair rapid-fire competition last year there, oh, heavens me, I've never seen guns blaze that fast before, I still suspect that must've been a Gun-Knight... a little bit young for it, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that look for? Didn't I tell you Recovery was famous? We have multiple people from the Basilica all recuperating here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you just say... the girl I brought here was newly moved into Stevonus?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never seen her before, that's why. If she's not your sister, then a kid that small can't have come scampering from another pagus, can she?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, obviously, there's the possibility I've just never seen her by pure chance. But I can tell a girl like her falls ill day in and day out... I've seen too many of them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where was I? Consulting in Pediatrics? Listen, last week...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here you are gossiping with the family again, Elisa. The doctor wants you at the test center to pick up the results.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serious Nurse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "On it\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blabbermouth Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
