    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_365_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, that attendant's headed for the head doctor's office. So what now, Patia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lateran Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#1$1",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "Allocate two to hold the report-deliverer back. Don't go big. Just hold things off, win a little time, and we're fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about that doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_365_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It looks like he's gone for Recovery. But not the end Cecelia's in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lateran Citizen?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_357_1#1$1",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? That works. This way, the executor'll still be in the dark for now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone else, with me. We'll draw the executor away, and get Cecelia out before the hospital's people reach her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember, move quick, but don't be rough with Cecelia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's our companion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't make her hate us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
