    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Mamma, why do we need to go so far every time we meet Daddy? It's really dark now...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Because... Daddy's not able to come to Lateran City. He can't live with us.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Why?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Because he's different from us.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Then can't we stay with Daddy?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Daddy wouldn't want you to stay with him, Cecelia. You'll understand when you're older...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Why...? Does Daddy not like me? Is it because I'm not good enough?\\nIf I'm a good girl, can Daddy be with us all the time?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Cecelia... you have to trust Daddy. He loves you, even if he can't be by our side.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
