    {
        "text": "Unnh... nnh....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mamma...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're awake!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who... Where am I...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're in the hospital, Miss. You fainted in the street, and I took you here since I couldn't find your parents.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hospital... is this a hospital?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... you\u2014you're wearing a uniform, Mamma said...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Has your mama been telling you things?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Come to think of it, when I first saw her, wasn't she hiding from me...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright, Miss, I can take you to find your mama. I'm a good guy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can help me find Mamma? Ma\u2014Mamma got taken away by people in gowns!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(This might just be a kidnapping case! Is that why she was all alone there?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, little Miss, stay calm. I'm a Notarial Hall executor. I'll help you find your mama. How did she get taken away?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a Notarial Hall...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right, I'm from the Notarial Hall. My name's Ezell. Look, here's my name tag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Will you really help me find Mamma?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. What's your name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm Cecelia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Nngh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
