    {
        "text": "Huh?! What's wrong with... your halo...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "(What is this about...? Even in the most downcast moods, Sankta halos don't dim like this.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unless...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "(But a child this small wouldn't even have a patron firearm yet. What could explain this...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Nnnh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "(No. Beyond that...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia, how do you feel? Is your halo...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sometimes... it goes like this... Mamma says I'm ill... it'll be fine soon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ezell has realized something."
    },
    {
        "text": "Amidst her current pain, Cecelia is anxious about her missing mother too."
    },
    {
        "text": "But he cannot sense any of her pain, nor anxiety, relayed from her."
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia... is without a doubt a Sankta."
    },
    {
        "text": "How could this be possible?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
