    {
        "text": "The rooftop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "You said Cecelia's circumstances were special. Special how?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_365_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... we can't be exactly sure yet. We'll need to wait for the diagnosis. The doctor will be here shortly. Just hold on, and we'll see what he has to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reserved Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've already reported Cecelia's situation to the Notarial Hall. My colleagues are fast on their way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_365_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 50,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reserved Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me who you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_365_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm an attendant, right? What are you talking about? The doctor will be here momentarily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reserved Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would a normal hospital attendant get nervous hearing the words 'Notarial Hall?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_365_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you suckered me... I only needed to keep you here for a short while anyway. If I were you, I wouldn't be giving myself trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reserved Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Patia said to be more gentle with Cecelia... but not with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reserved Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Patia,' was it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_365_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd do well to forget that one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reserved Hospital Attendant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on out. Let's give our Notarial Hall man some break time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reserved Hospital Attendant"
    },
